  "body": "Positioned directly opposite the vibrant heart of Long Bay Village, this two-bedroom Universal Home delivers low-maintenance living at its finest. Owned and cared for from new, it offers an honest, well-designed footprint that makes starting out, slowing down, or securing an easy-care investment completely seamless.\r\n\r\nWhat You'll Love:\r\n- Smart dual-level layout with double glazing throughout for year-round warmth and quiet comfort\r\n- Open-plan dining flowing straight into a sleek, modern kitchen that gets bathed in morning sun\r\n- Main living area opening out to a sun-drenched patio designed for afternoon warmth and total privacy\r\n- Dedicated upper-level master suite complete with its own private ensuite\r\n- Comfort covered in all seasons with heat pumps installed in both upstairs bedrooms\r\n- Practical configuration featuring a separate lower-level guest toilet alongside the main upstairs bathroom\r\n- Single garage supported by an additional off-street park for absolute daily convenience\r\n- Balance of a Master Build Guarantee remaining for total peace of mind\r\n- Freehold title with no body corporate fees for total ownership freedom and minimal ongoing costs\r\n\r\nBest Bits From the Vendor\r\n\"This was our first home and honestly it couldn't have been better. Catching that morning sun in the master bedroom and kitchen just makes every day start right. Having the garage has been awesome for hobbies and projects, or even just as a guaranteed park on market days when things get busy. The private backyard has been great for hosting family and just chilling in the garden with the setting sun. We visit the park every day, and having the day-care right across the street has been such a special community for our family. You really don't realize how easy life is here until you live it.\"\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Location\r\nPennant Street places every local convenience right at your doorstep. Step across the road to Long Bay Village for your morning brew, local day-care, dining, and shops, or cross over to the green for the monthly community market. Long Bay Regional Park and the beach are just a short walk down the road for weekend strolls, with local schools, sports fields, and public transport links all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA solid, low-maintenance home in a position that simply makes life easier. Come take a look and see how effortless living here can be.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: Tuesday 3rd November 1pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nWatch 'The Reel Open Home' - https://youtube.com/shorts/koTuZt_JHlU\r\n\r\n*Floor area and land area sourced from Auckland Council records.\r\nAgents happy to work in with your buyers.",
